  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-geographically-weighted-regression.\n\n- Implements Geographically Weighted Regression (GWR) with bisquare and gaussian kernels, providing spatially varying local coefficients.\n- Selects optimal fixed bandwidth from multiple candidates using AICc cross-validation.\n- Outputs include GeoTIFFs of local coefficients and local R\u00b2, and supporting JSON stats/manifest files.\n- Supports both synthetic data generation and CSV input for real datasets; fully offline operation with no network requests.\n- Documents methodology, usage examples, output structure, limitations, and dependencies.",
